{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13071","headline":"奉和杜相公益昌路作 · 郎士元","name":"奉和杜相公益昌路作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春半梁山正落花，台衡受律向天涯。\n南去猨声傍双节，西来江色遶千家。\n风吹画角孤城晓，林映蛾眉片月斜。\n已见庙谟能喻蜀，新文更喜报金华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}